2:[["$","div",null,{"className":"aeo-answer tl-dr","children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Quick Answer:"}]," An NDA 2027 study plan should span 5-7 months and cover two papers — Mathematics (300 marks) and the General Ability Test (600 marks: English + GK + Physics + Chemistry + History + Geography + Current Affairs). Math is the highest-weightage single subject and the biggest differentiator. Study 5-7 hours daily, prioritizing Math (50% of total marks) and Physics. Use an AI planner like PlanBot to rotate subjects, schedule daily current affairs, and balance written-exam prep with physical fitness for the SSB interview."]}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why NDA Is Different From Other Entrance Exams"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"NDA (National Defence Academy) is the joint-services entrance exam for the Indian Army, Navy, and Air Force — conducted twice a year by UPSC. It's unique among competitive exams for two reasons:"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It's a two-stage selection"}]," — the written exam (900 marks) is only half the battle. The 5-day SSB interview is the real test. You must clear both."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It favors 11th/12th students"}]," — the syllabus is Class 11-12 level, so aspirants start young (often Class 11). This means you compete with a serious, prepared cohort."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Over ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"5-6 lakh candidates"}]," appear for NDA each cycle, for roughly 400 seats. But here's the opportunity: most candidates under-prepare for Math (worth 300 marks) and ignore the SSB entirely until the written result."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"If you plan for both stages from day one, you're in the top 10% strategically."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Understanding the NDA Written Exam Pattern"}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Paper"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Subject"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Questions"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Marks"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Time"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"1"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Mathematics"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"120"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"300"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"2.5 hours"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"2"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"General Ability Test (GAT)"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"150"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"600"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"2.5 hours"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Total:"}]," 900 marks · Negative marking (0.33 per wrong answer in both papers) · English-only exam (except some language questions)"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"GAT Breakdown (600 marks)"}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Section"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Marks"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Weightage"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"English"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"200"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"33%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Physics"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"100 (part of 400 GK)"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"~17%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Chemistry"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"60"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"~10%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"General Science (Bio)"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"40"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"~7%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"History, Freedom Movement"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"80"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"~13%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Geography"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"80"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"~13%"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Current Events"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"40"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"~7%"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Key insight:"}]," Math (300) + English (200) = 500 of 900 marks (56%). Master these two and you're past the cutoff."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The 6-Month NDA Master Plan"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 1: Foundation (Months 1-3)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Objective:"}]," Complete Class 11-12 NCERT for all subjects + Math mastery"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study Target:"}]," 5-6 hours"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Section Split:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Mathematics: 2-2.5 hours/day (non-negotiable priority)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"English: 1 hour/day"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Physics: 1 hour/day"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"GK (History, Geo, Chem, Bio): 1 hour/day (rotate)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Current Affairs: 20-30 min/day"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mathematics Strategy (the make-or-break paper):"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["NDA Math is Class 11-12 level but tests ",["$","em",null,{"children":"speed and accuracy"}],". 120 questions in 150 minutes = 75 seconds per question."]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"High-weightage topics:"}]," Matrices & Determinants, Vectors, Calculus (Differential + Integral), Probability, Trigonometry, Coordinate Geometry"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Lower priority:"}]," Statistics, Set Theory (quick wins)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Practice 80-100 questions daily once fundamentals are clear"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Build a formula sheet — revise daily"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Source: NCERT Class 11-12 + R.S. Aggarwal for practice"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"English Strategy:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Vocabulary is king — 50 words daily (NDA tests synonyms, antonyms, idioms)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Grammar: Parts of Speech, Tenses, Prepositions, Articles"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Comprehension: 2-3 passages daily"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Sentence Improvement, Spotting Errors — daily drill"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Physics Strategy:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Class 11-12 NCERT, but NDA tests ",["$","em",null,{"children":"conceptual application"}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"High-weightage: Mechanics, Optics, Electricity, Modern Physics"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Make a \"laws and formulas\" sheet"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"NDA 2027, Class 12 student. Can study 6 hours. Weak in Math and Physics.\""}]," PlanBot front-loads Math during peak focus hours and builds daily English vocab + current affairs blocks."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 2: Practice & Sectional Mastery (Months 4-5)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Objective:"}]," Build speed + start full-length mocks"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study Target:"}]," 6-7 hours"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What Changes:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Shift from learning to ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"timed practice"}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Start sectional mocks (Math + GAT separately)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Daily 100+ Math questions under time pressure"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Build Current Affairs diary (last 6 months)"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Math Speed Targets:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"50 questions in 60 minutes (Prelims-level speed)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"80 questions in 100 minutes"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Full 120 questions in 150 minutes (month 5)"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"GAT Speed Targets:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"English section: 50 questions in 25 min"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"GK section: 100 questions in 80 min"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"Math mock score 90/300. Slow in Calculus and Vectors.\""}]," PlanBot reallocates two weeks to those topics with timed practice sets."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 3: Mocks + SSB Foundation (Month 6)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Objective:"}]," Full-length mock series + light SSB prep"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study Target:"}]," 6 hours"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What Changes:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"4-5 full-length NDA mocks per week (Math + GAT back-to-back, simulating real exam)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Deep analysis after each mock"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Start light SSB preparation (don't neglect this — many written qualifiers fail SSB)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Current Affairs final revision"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"SSB Foundation (light, 30-45 min/day):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Read about the 5-day SSB process (Screening, Psych tests, GTO, Interview, Conference)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Start reading newspapers editorially (builds awareness for interview)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Light physical fitness (running, basic exercises)"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Why start SSB prep now?"}]," SSB is 5 days of intense psychological + physical testing. You can't prepare for it in the 2-3 weeks between written result and SSB call. Build habits now."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The Physical Fitness Angle (Unique to NDA)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Unlike other exams, NDA requires you to be physically fit. Start early:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily:"}]," 20-30 min running/jogging"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"3x/week:"}]," Push-ups, sit-ups, pull-ups (build to 15+ each)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Weekend:"}]," Longer runs (3-5 km)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["PlanBot can integrate fitness into your daily schedule — ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"Add 30 min of running at 6am and 20 min push-ups at 7pm.\""}]," The AI treats fitness as a non-negotiable block, just like study."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to Use PlanBot for NDA — A Practical Workflow"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Set your goal:"}]," Download PlanBot, choose Student persona: ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"NDA 2027 (April attempt), Class 12. Math and Physics are weak. Can study 6 hours daily + 30 min fitness.\""}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Get a written + SSB + fitness plan:"}]," PlanBot schedules all three streams so you're not scrambling post-written-result."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Math-first scheduling:"}]," PlanBot always puts Math in your highest-energy block — it's 33% of total marks and the biggest differentiator."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Current affairs continuity:"}]," A fixed daily block ensures you never cram Current Affairs in the last week."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Streaks for the long game:"}]," NDA prep is 6 months of daily effort. Streaks keep you going when Class 12 boards or college pressure compete for your time."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Common NDA Mistakes That Cost Selection"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Neglecting Math"}]," — it's 33% of marks and the highest-scoring paper for serious aspirants"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ignoring SSB until written result"}]," — SSB has a ~10% selection rate; you need months of prep"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"No physical fitness"}]," — even written qualifiers fail the medical/physical tests"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Cramming Current Affairs"}]," — NDA tests the last 6-8 months; daily reading is essential"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Not doing full-length mocks"}]," — 5 hours of continuous testing needs stamina-building"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Can I crack NDA without coaching?"}]," Yes. NCERT + a good Math practice book + consistent mocks is enough. Coaching helps with structure — which an AI planner provides."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Is NDA Math harder than JEE?"}]," No — NDA Math is Class 11-12 level. JEE Math is significantly harder. But NDA rewards speed more than JEE."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How important is physical fitness during prep?"}]," Critical. Don't wait until SSB. Start running daily from month 1."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Start Your NDA 2027 Journey Today"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"NDA selection rewards the well-rounded — strong in Math, sharp in English, physically fit, and SSB-ready. The aspirants who clear it planned for all four pillars from day one."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","children":"Get PlanBot free on Android"}]," and let the AI build your NDA 2027 study schedule."]}]]
